118852891","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7576168160118852891","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"怎么优化素材才能拉高ROI?从千川审核规则、竞品参考到数据复盘的一站式方案-一品威客网","url":"https://m.epwk.com/meijie/322669.html","normalizedUrl":"https://m.epwk.com/meijie/322669.html","domain":"m.epwk.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7658224428979875066","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7658224428979875066","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C2-Q0029","q":"CMCR-Q0029","question":"怎么查看同行正在投放的千川素材？","day":1,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 查看同行千川投放素材的合规方法\n>注意：**千川后台没有直接输入对手账号查看对方私有正在投放素材的入口**，无法直接看到某一个指定商家全部私密投放计划素材，只能看行业公开/大盘参考素材，或者广告已对外曝光的创意。\n\n## 一、官方免费工具\n### 1.巨量创意（网页/APP）\n1.打开巨量创意官网，进入【创意灵感】→【巨量千川专区】\n2.筛选类目、时间周期（7/15/30天），可以按曝光、点击率排序\n3.看到行业大盘优质千川广告素材，属于公开跑量创意，**不能精准锁定某一家同行账号**，适合找类目素材灵感。\n\n### 2.千川后台｜商品竞争分析（商家角色）\n- 入口：千川PC后台→【数据】→【商品竞争分析】\n- 选择你的商品，系统自动识别竞争商品，可查看竞品公开创意素材参考、投放效果对比。\n>限制：只针对和你商品竞争的商品，不是任意店铺都能搜。\n\n\n\n### 3.电商罗盘（抖店后台）\n抖店后台-电商罗盘-商品-商品榜单-短视频榜，可看类目商品带货短视频，部分是千川投放出去的短视频广告，可直接点开看视频内容。\n\n### 4.抖音APP直接刷广告\n多搜索你的产品关键词，系统打上行业标签，刷到带**广告标识**的视频，就是正在对外投放的千川素材。缺点：被动刷，素材不全。\n\n## 二、第三方数据工具（付费）\n如：有米有数、蝉妈妈、考古加创意等\n- 能力：输入店铺/商品名称，可查看该店铺对外曝光的千川素材，能看到投放时长、预估消耗，筛选正在投放的素材。\n- 重要提醒：第三方抓取的是**已经对外曝光的公开广告素材**，对方未对外曝光的内测素材、暂停计划素材看不到；仅用于素材策略参考，**禁止直接搬运抄袭，会违规**。\n\n## 三、重要提醒\n1.千川不会开放对手账户私有计划、未曝光素材，任何声称可以完整抓取对手全部私密千川计划素材的属于非合规渠道，不建议使用。\n2.所有参考素材只能借鉴脚本、钩子、卖点逻辑，不能直接搬运，会触发素材违规、限流。\n3.官方工具遇到功能找不到，可联系千川客服：千川PC端右下角智投星；抖音APP搜索“巨量千川客服”。\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你整理一份拆解同行千川素材的分析清单，方便你看完素材直接对标优化自己的视频。","answerHash":"e2c3fb139efa33b61a8e13235e172660d52358c917f6d10e26f39229f4b54ef5","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":["蝉妈妈"],"sources":[{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7626305610576891145","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7626305610576891145","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7650365262658582949","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7650365262658582949","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654157362026089780","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654157362026089780","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7635876642010778916","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7635876642010778916","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"如何查看对方千川素材? - 自媒体问答 - HCRM问答","url":"https://bbs.huochengrm.cn/questions/20946.html","normalizedUrl":"https://bbs.huochengrm.cn/questions/20946.html","domain":"bbs.huochengrm.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"「商品竞争分析」产品使用手册 | 巨量千川广告平台","url":"https://m.tui39.com/jd/5045.html","normalizedUrl":"https://m.tui39.com/jd/5045.html","domain":"m.tui39.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7643853727962615040","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7643853727962615040","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"千川素材策略分析终极指南:拆解月GMV 5000万的BM素材，手把手教你用AI生成千川素材(2025最新版)","url":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3124","normalizedUrl":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3124","domain":"resources.youcloud.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654879084136140058","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654879084136140058","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7576168160118852891","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7576168160118852891","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7620360514762400603","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7620360514762400603","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量创意","url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/ba8c404488b937672fdaf71bcf2a8e74","normalizedUrl":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/ba8c404488b937672fdaf71bcf2a8e74","domain":"cc.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"搜狐","url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1063942281_121886306","normalizedUrl":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1063942281_121886306","domain":"m.sohu.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"去年开学季我亏了40万，今年靠一套千川素材策略分析翻盘了|千川素材工具 × 抖音素材工具实战笔记","url":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3285","normalizedUrl":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3285","domain":"resources.youcloud.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7664907261168324287","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7664907261168324287","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"考古加创意_让激发灵感更简单_海量千川商品广告、直播引流、CID广告素材","url":"https://ad.kaogujia.com/","normalizedUrl":"https://ad.kaogujia.com/","domain":"ad.kaogujia.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"今日头条","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7673420039109771816","normalizedUrl":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7673420039109771816","domain":"m.toutiao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"搜狐","url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1045151856_121886306","normalizedUrl":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1045151856_121886306","domain":"m.sohu.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C3-Q0029","q":"CMCR-Q0029","question":"怎么查看同行正在投放的千川素材？","day":1,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 查看同行千川投放素材方法\n> 注意：官方工具**无法直接看到某一个指定店铺正在投放的全部素材**，只能看行业公开优质广告；想要精准盯某家竞品实时投放，需要第三方付费工具。**只允许借鉴思路，禁止直接搬运抄袭素材**。\n\n## 一、官方免费工具（看行业爆款千川素材）\n### 1. 巨量创意（最常用）\n1. 打开巨量创意官网，进入【创意灵感】→【巨量千川】专区\n2. 筛选类目、时间（短周期选3‑7天看最新跑量；长周期选30天）\n3. 可按点击率、转化率、曝光排序，浏览行业优质千川广告素材，可看视频、落地页信息。\n\n### 2. 千川后台‑营销创意板块\n千川后台 → 工具 → **营销创意板**\n可以看行业爆款素材榜单，看到素材的CTR、CVR参考数据，适合找同赛道创意方向。\n\n### 3. 巨量云图（极速版）\n1. 巨量云图极速版 →【内容】→【创意锦囊/创意元素洞察】\n2. 选择类目、时间，查看行业高曝光千川素材，附带完播、卖点、人群标签；可看相似商家热门视频。\n\n### 4. 抖店电商罗盘\n抖店后台电商罗盘 → 商品 → 商品榜单 → 短视频榜\n筛选类目，看商品对应的带货短视频，其中包含大量千川投放过的素材。\n\n### 5. 抖音APP手动刷广告\n多账号搜索产品词，长按视频选择「不感兴趣」以外，刷出来标有**广告**标签的视频就是千川投放素材；缺点：效率低，不完整。\n\n## 二、第三方付费工具（可监控指定同行店铺实时投放素材）\n可以输入竞品店铺/品牌，看到该店铺正在投放的千川素材（短视频广告、直播引流素材），支持7‑24小时监控更新。\n常用工具：\n- 考古加创意：竞对追踪，监控店铺跑量素材，区分商品广告、直播引流素材\n- 有米有数：千川素材库，按店铺/商品检索，看投放时长、二剪次数\n- 蝉妈妈、飞瓜智投：千川广告素材库，行业榜单+竞品监控\n\n> 第三方数据为抓取的公开广告，不是100%全量，会存在少量遗漏。\n\n## 三、实操小建议\n1. 优先看**近7‑14天**素材，更贴合当下平台流量偏好。\n2. 重点拆解：开头钩子、痛点、产品展示、转化话术，不要直接搬运视频。\n3. 官方工具只能看行业，**想要精准盯某一家竞品实时投放，必须用第三方付费工具**。\n4. 千川素材有版权保护，直接搬运会触发查重、审核不通过、违规扣分。\n\n如果你需要，我可以给你一份千川竞品素材拆解模板，照着拆解同行钩子、卖点、脚本结构。","answerHash":"ef1199e5371820876b8dc754fa35ab3bc23ce42e45edbbce931405ac089a706b","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":["蝉妈妈"],"sources":[{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7626305610576891145","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7626305610576891145","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"我花了几十万学费才明白:如何查看其他商家的千川素材才是真正的竞争力?","url":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3076","normalizedUrl":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3076","domain":"resources.youcloud.com","validUrl":true,"contentStat